3n pantalla-cuerpo (sin altavoces): 83.56%<\/li>  <li>Reproducci\u00f3n del v\u00eddeo sobre la duraci\u00f3n de la bater\u00eda: Hasta 11 horas y 45 minutos<\/li>  <li>Se requiere registro: No<\/li>  <li>Sistema operativo: FreeDOS<\/li>  <li>Sonido: Audio de B&amp;O; Altavoces duales; HP Audio Boost<\/li>  <li>Tama\u00f1o de la pantalla (diagonal): 16,1' (40,9 cm)<\/li>  <li>Teclado: Teclado de tama\u00f1o completo, con retroiluminaci\u00f3n, de color azul intenso y teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li>  <li>Tiempo de carga de la bater\u00eda: Es compatible con la carga r\u00e1pida de la bater\u00eda: aproximadamente 50% en 30 minutos<\/li>  <li>Tipo de almacenamiento: SSD<\/li>  <li>Tipo de bater\u00eda: Pol\u00edmero de ion-litio 4 celdas, 70 Wh<\/li>  <li>Tipo de fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n: Adaptador de alimentaci\u00f3n Smart AC de 200 W<\/li>  <li>Unidad \u00f3ptica: Unidad \u00f3ptica no incluida<\/li>  <li>Webcam: C\u00e1mara HP Wide Vision 720p HD con reducci\u00f3n de ruido temporal y micr\u00f3fonos digitales de matriz dual integrados<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":706.04,"unit_price_tax":706.04,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles Gaming","quantity":0,"brand":"HP","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_hpp-victus%2016-e1005ns_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":701.04}}},"0197528240213":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0197528240213",false],"wholesale_price":[569,false],"price":[574,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"tags":["",fals